#. comic173 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic173#title.1"
msgid "\"TOUGH LOVE\""
msgstr "«ЖЁСТКАЯ ЛЮБОВЬ»"

#. comic173 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:77
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic173#p1.1"
msgid "Bogey, you should be ashamed of yourself, taking glee in Radd's misfortune."
msgstr "Бяка, как тебе не стыдно злорадствовать над бедой Улёта."

#. comic173 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic173#p1.2"
msgid "Hey, I do care about the guy, or else I wouldn't have saved him."
msgstr "Эй, мне он не безразличен, иначе я бы его не спас."

#. comic173 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeytabled2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:134
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic173#p2.1"
msgid "But Radd still hasn't learned how things work in the real world, and needs to learn to play by the rules. If nothing else, this'll teach him that his actions have consequences."
msgstr "Но Улёт так и не понял, как устроен реальный мир, и ему пора научиться играть по правилам. По крайней мере, он узнает, что у его поступков бывают последствия."

#. comic173 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:185
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic173#p3.1"
msgid "I guess you're right."
msgstr "Пожалуй, ты прав."

#. comic173 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:189
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic173#p3.2"
msgid "Plus, it frees up some closetspace for me."
msgstr "К тому же у меня в шкафу освободилось место."

#. comic173 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:237
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic173#p4.1"
msgid "I'm glad to see your priorities are straight."
msgstr "Рада видеть, что приоритеты у тебя правильные."

#. comic173 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:241
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic173#p4.2"
msgid "And I won't have to vacuum nearly as often, either!"
msgstr "И пылесосить придётся куда реже!"

