#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic184.htm:187
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic184#p3.1"
msgid "It's like the humans' own hypothetical dilemma, about whether saving millions of people is adequate justification for killing one man. Well, is it?"
